  "level": 2,
  "question": {
    "text": "A curve amongst the family of curves represented by the differential equation, <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mfenced><mi>&#160;</mi><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mi>y</mi><mi>&#160;</mi><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math> which passes through <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced></math>, is",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [
    {
      "id": "ePO1E",
      "text": "A circle with centre on the <math><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo></math> axis.",
      "isCorrect": true,
      "image": null
    },
    {
      "id": "uWumO",
      "text": "A circle with centre on the <math><mi>y</mi><mo>-</mo></math> axis.",
      "isCorrect": false,
      "image": null
    },
    {
      "id": "mR1gV",
      "text": "A hyperbola with transverse axis along the <math><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo></math> axis.",
      "isCorrect": false,
      "image": null
    },
    {
      "id": "5BnVy",
      "text": "An ellipse with major axis along the <math><mi>y</mi><mo>-</mo></math> axis.",
      "isCorrect": false,
      "image": null
    }
  ],
  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mi>y</mi><mi>&#160;</mi><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p><math><msup><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><msup><mrow><mi>y</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mi>&#160;</mi><mi>y</mi><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi></math></p><p><math><mo>&#8658;</mo><mo>-</mo><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>d</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mfrac><mrow><msup><mrow><mi>y</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></mrow><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mfenced></math>&nbsp; (exact differential equation)</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>&#160;</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mi>x</mi></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mi>C</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mi>C</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p><math><mo>&#8757;</mo><mi>&#160;</mi></math>It passes through <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced></math>.</p><p>Hence,&nbsp;<math><mi>C</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p>",
